   "id": null,
   "title": "Exterior Design",
   "intro": "The Gran Turismo 40 Open is designed to elevate every experience on the water, offering generous living spaces and a variety of outdoor environments tailored for relaxation, entertainment, and adventure.\nAt the bow, the wraparound U-shaped seating area creates an inviting social space with panoramic views and easily converts into a secluded sunpad thanks to an electric pedestal table. Aft, the spacious cockpit can be upgraded with an electric table leg and sunpad infill, transforming the area into an additional lounging space ideal for entertaining guests or unwinding at anchor.voici\nOwners can tailor onboard comfort with a choice of shading solutions. These systems extend protection across the cockpit, side terraces, and bathing platform, creating generous shaded areas for relaxing outdoors.",
   "items": [],
