   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "The interior of the Gran Turismo 40 Open embraces Japanese Kanso philosophy, where simplicity, comfort, and versatility come together to create a calm and welcoming atmosphere.\nThe forward living area effortlessly converts from a welcoming dinette into a transverse double berth, while the aft cabin provides a comfortable retreat for relaxing or overnight stays. Lined privacy curtains in both spaces enhance comfort and intimacy on board.\nThe spacious bathroom with a separate shower stall enhances onboard living with a relaxing sense of wellness and luxury.\nRefined finishes, ambient lighting, and an optional 32-inch TV seamlessly integrated beneath the T-top roof enrich the onboard experience, enhancing the Gran Turismo’s signature balance of luxury and functionality.",
